ly  gained a large fan base after appearing  in season 5 episode 8 for the first time  brenn was a beloved dancer with a  fantastic technique but the mama drama  never seemed to end between her her mom  Ashley Kendall and  both mom Jill after several tears and  plenty of screaming the elite team  finally disbanded in season seven  episode 25 and with that the Dance Moms  path was over for brynne our editor  pointed out that the show might not have  been the best thing that happened to  Brynn it put the normally very technical  and beautiful dancer through far too  many challenges that aren't normal even  in the professional dancing world their  editor also pointed out that weeks after  weeks you could see how filming took a  toll on her spirit but it seems that  this spirit is finally back now that  Dance Moms is over friend continued to  dance she appeared on numerous social  media videos as well as plenty of dance  and cheer competitions in July 2018 Fran  also opened up about being bullied  online by an adult woman who posed under  a Dance Moms fan accounts she was using  to make money  Nia sue Nia has been keeping busy since  Dance Moms she's already been making  moves while on the show and it only grew  stronger Nia actually remained the only  og cast member on the show that stayed  for the duration of seven seasons and  she definitely has the thick skin to  show for it  being on Dance Moms taught this little  diva how to be obviously resilient and  she's determined to not give up when it  comes to her dreams  Nia continued to pursue her passion in  music and performing in 2016 Nia  announced her first role on Broadway as  a character in a dance show called trip  of love in 2017 she appeared on the  irreplaceable store alongside her fellow  elite team Dance Moms members that left  the tour for unknown reasons  in the meantime Nia has become a huge  social media star with more than 4.5  million followers in 2018 she appeared  on the bold and the beautiful soap o