 camus  which featured two covers and three  original songs she also landed some  sweet modeling opportunities which  included a gig for fenty ex Puma as of  August 2018 her IMDB page also shows  that she's a cast member for a live  action movie and Nastasia currently in  post-production it's not yet clear where  she will go in terms of her music career  in 2018 but we're very excited to see  what this triple threat will do  next Eliana bonsly nobody knew what to  expect when Abby Lee announced that she  was making a brand new team full of many  dancers and it was even more confusing  because almost everyone's name ended  with Anna  but one person definitely stood out from  the rest Eliana is a talented dancer who  became a part of the main cast when she  was just 10 years old as the show ended  Eliana can still be found dancing at  various competitions she also appeared  in several 10-minute challenge videos  taken by the popular dance photographer  Jordan matter but that's not all it  looks like in August 2018 Dancing with  the Stars jr. shared a behind-the-scenes  photo of Ileana and some other talented  kid dancers let's be honest any dance  show is better with Eliana in it Eliana  could also be seen at Abby Lee Miller's  side as her former dance teacher battles  cancer in the hospital it's absolutely  heartwarming that this little kid is so  busy but yet makes the time to show love  and give positive vibes to those that  taught her a lot about the dance world  Chloe look hey Zack  Chloe was a beloved dancer and  everyone's hearts got collectively  broken when she left in season 4 we've  already pointed out a lot of things that  were wrong in this show in one of our  other videos but let's be honest  Abby's treatment of Chloe was one of the  most uncomfortable things about this  show but Chloe has been doing extremely  well for herself since she left the show  we all know she also came back in season  7 and attended to the irreplaceable  store but so much has happened in  between in 2016 Chloe appeared in center  stage on points where she played Gwyn  Murphy 2017 was also a big year for her  in terms of acting she worked on 4  separate movie projects and proceeded  acting in 2018 she is also credited as a  co-executive producer in a movie called  fr EDI in 2018 she also released her  very own book and even launched a book  club to encourage kids to read although  it's obvious that Chloe still dances it  looks like she's definitely taking a lot  of interest in plenty of other career  paths in the entertainment industry and  you know as they say the sky is the  limit  McKenzie Ziegler we all remember little  Mackenzie from her colorful statements  on the show like the time she said she  just wants to stay at home and eat chips  and  really go on dance competitions but  since then McKenzie has become a teenage  inspiration along with having a pretty  successful music career McKenzie created  her very own turn board which helps  dancers with their turns we've also seen  her in plenty of viral hip hop dance  videos where she dances alongside her  teacher Rumer Noel in 2018 makenzie also  went on a dance tour with her sister  Maddy where she showed she definitely  still has what it takes to be on dance  competitions McKenzie has also been busy  being a popular influencer on the  lip-sync app called musically as of  August 2018 she has an impressive 11  million followers on her Instagram these  days you can find her performing her  songs with her fellow music Johnny  Orlando although it seemed that everyone  wanted makenzie to follow in Maddie's  footsteps it looks like she was able to  create a path of her own way to go candy  make sure you comment down below and  tell us what your favorite Kenzie song  Maddie Ziegler how could we possibly  forget about the one and only Maddie  Ziegler arguably the star of the show  maddie officially left Dance Moms in  season 6 episode 8 team since then she  appeared in numerous SIA music videos  and spent a lot of time dancing  alongside SIA on her tour in 2016 Maddie  also launched her very own fashion line  which was one of the many business moves  this young superstar has made at 14 she  also got cast as a judge on So You Think  You Can Dance alongside Paula Abdul in  2017 she released a memoir titled  the Maddie Diaries which became the New  York Times best seller and if that  wasn't enough she also landed a role in  movies like ballerina and the book of  Henry it looks like this business savvy  team isn't stopping anytime soon as of  2018 she landed a commercial deal with  Tiffany &amp; Co and she continues to appear  at various fashion dance and  entertainment events despite all her  adventures Maddie's still a dancer  Burghardt who practices for hours and  hours every single day until she  perfects her moves but she's not the  only person that's doing well for  herself  this next Dance Moms star only had a few  hundred Instagram followers when she  joined to the show in season 5 episode 3  but since then she became quite a  character  Jodeci WA if you spend a lot of time on  Twitter these days you probably noticed  that Jojo C hua seems to be known a lot  more than some  the other Dance Moms stars this power  dancer started her career on Dance Moms  with a lot of sass  and even more hair bows combined with  her moves full of attitude she quickly  became a popular character she  unexpectedly left the show at the end of  season six and although there were many  rumors floating around her exit was  never really properly explained but  since then  JoJo's definitely been making moves with  her incredibly successful YouTube  channel with over seven million  subscribers she also released a bow  collection at a popular retailer called  Claire's and collaborated with YouTube  superstars such as Miranda sings in 2018  Twitter started taking notice of JoJo's  personality and she immediately became a  meme people couldn't believe how tall  she is did you know she's five nine  seriously Twitter can't get over this  height but regardless  Jojo is definitely one of the most  talked-about Dance Moms members of 2018  and we have a feeling she'll continue to  be well after that and if that's not yet  impressive  Jojo also signed an overall talent deal  with Nickelodeon meaning you'll be  seeing this Dance Moms star even more  and that's it for our video thanks for  watching  see you next time  [Music]

